<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>单局复盘 game{{ digest.meta.game }} · umaai_review</title>
<style>
  :root { --fg:#1f2937; --muted:#6b7280; --line:#e5e7eb; --bg:#f6f8fb; --card:#ffffff; }
  * { box-sizing:border-box; }
  body { margin:0; padding:24px; font-family:"Segoe UI","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;
         color:var(--fg); background:var(--bg); }
  .wrap { max-width:960px; margin:0 auto; }
  h1 { font-size:22px; margin:0 0 4px; }
  .sub { color:var(--muted); font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .cards { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(150px,1fr));
           gap:10px; margin-bottom:12px; }
  .card { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
          padding:10px 14px; }
  .card .k { font-size:11.5px; color:var(--muted); }
  .card .v { font-size:17px; font-weight:600; margin-top:2px; word-break:break-all; }
  .deck { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
          padding:10px 14px; margin-bottom:18px; font-size:13px; }
  .chip { display:inline-block; background:#eef2ff; border-radius:999px;
          padding:2px 10px; margin:2px 4px 2px 0; white-space:nowrap; }
  section { background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px;
            padding:14px 18px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  h2 { font-size:15px; margin:0 0 10px; color:#111827; }
  summary { cursor:pointer; font-size:15px; margin:0 0 10px; color:#111827;
            font-weight:600; user-select:none; }
  svg { max-width:100%; height:auto; display:block; }
  table { border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:12.5px; }
  th, td { border:1px solid var(--line); padding:4px 8px; text-align:left;
           vertical-align:top; }
  th { background:#f1f5f9; }
  tr:nth-child(even) td { background:#fafafa; }
  .num { text-align:right; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
  .sev-warn { color:#b45309; font-weight:600; }
  .sev-info { color:#2563eb; }
  footer { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; line-height:1.7; margin-top:8px; }
  .note { color:var(--muted); font-size:12px; margin:6px 0; }
{% if has_bg %}  /* 背景装饰：输出目录存在 yayoi.png 时自动启用（skill 只需复制图片，无需改 HTML） */
  body::before { content:""; position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:-1;
                 background:url("yayoi.png") center/cover no-repeat; opacity:0.2; }
  :root { --card:rgba(255,255,255,0.7); }
{% endif %}</style>
</head>
<body><div class="wrap">

<h1>单局复盘 · game{{ digest.meta.game }}</h1>
<div class="sub">
  umaai_review 生成 · 马娘 {{ digest.meta.uma_name }}（{{ digest.meta.uma_id }}）·
  结束方式 {{ digest.meta.end_reason }}{% if digest.meta.start_turn > 0 %} ·
  中途接管（起始回合 {{ digest.meta.start_turn }}）{% endif %} ·
  执行推断一致率 {{ overview.match_rate }}%
</div>

<div class="cards">
  <div class="card"><div class="k">终局评分</div>
    <div class="v">{% if digest.meta.final_score is not none %}{{ digest.meta.final_score }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">等级</div>
    <div class="v">{{ digest.meta.rank or "—" }}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">终局运气分</div>
    <div class="v">{% if digest.meta.total_luck_end is not none %}{{ digest.meta.total_luck_end | round(1) }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">五维终值（速/耐/力/根/智，显示值）</div>
    <div class="v" style="font-size:13px">{{ overview.five_status | join(" / ") or "—" }}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">体力 / 干劲</div>
    <div class="v">{{ overview.vital or "—" }} / {{ overview.motivation or "—" }}</div></div>
  <div class="card"><div class="k">快照 / 决策行</div>
    <div class="v">{{ digest.meta.snapshots }} / {{ digest.meta.decision_rows }}</div></div>
</div>

<div class="deck"><b>卡组</b>：
  {% for c in digest.meta.deck %}<span class="chip">{{ c.name }} · {{ c.limit_break }}破</span>{% endfor %}
</div>

{% if narrative.overview %}{{ narrative.overview | safe }}{% else %}<!-- NARRATIVE:overview -->{% endif %}

<section><details open><summary>图1 · 属性成长曲线</summary>{{ chart_status | safe }}
<table>
  <tr><th>年段</th><th>训练次数（速/耐/力/根/智）</th><th>五维净增（速/耐/力/根/智）</th></tr>
  {% for y in digest.training.years %}
  <tr><td>{{ y.label }}</td><td class="num">{{ y.train_counts | join(" / ") }}</td>
      <td class="num">{% for g in y.gains %}{{ "+" if g >= 0 else "" }}{{ g }}{% if not loop.last %} / {% endif %}{% endfor %}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
<div class="note">训练 = 推断实际动作计数；净增 = 年段差分（含事件 / 继承 / 比赛奖励）。运气归属（回合合计 Δ 计入当回合训练维；自选 swing 与学技能回合已剔除归程序性大波动）：
  速 {{ digest.training.luck_by_attr[0] | round | int }} /
  耐 {{ digest.training.luck_by_attr[1] | round | int }} /
  力 {{ digest.training.luck_by_attr[2] | round | int }} /
  根 {{ digest.training.luck_by_attr[3] | round | int }} /
  智 {{ digest.training.luck_by_attr[4] | round | int }}，
  非训练回合 {{ digest.training.luck_other | round | int }}，
  程序性大波动回合 {{ digest.training.luck_program | round | int }}。</div>
</details></section>
<section><details open><summary>图2 · 运气分双轴</summary>{{ chart_luck | safe }}</details></section>

{% if narrative.luck_trend %}{{ narrative.luck_trend | safe }}{% else %}<!-- NARRATIVE:luck_trend -->{% endif %}

<section><details open><summary>图3 · 实际执行行动总计</summary>{{ chart_actions | safe }}</details></section>

{% if narrative.findings %}{{ narrative.findings | safe }}{% else %}<!-- NARRATIVE:findings -->{% endif %}

{% if digest.inherit %}
<section>
<details open>
<summary>继承质量（参考值 {{ digest.inherit.reference_value or "—" }}）</summary>
<table>
  <tr><th>回合</th><th>继承贡献（五维）</th><th>偏差</th></tr>
  {% for c in digest.inherit.contributions %}
  <tr><td class="num">{{ c.turn }}</td><td class="num">{{ c.five_status_sum }}</td>
      <td class="num">{% if c.deviation is not none %}{{ c.deviation }}{% else %}—{% endif %}</td></tr>
  {% endfor %}
</table>
<div class="note">{{ digest.inherit.dev_note }}</div>
</details>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if digest.clones %}
<section>
<details open>
<summary>分身彩圈观测</summary>
<table>
  <tr><th>类别</th><th>新增分身</th><th>落得意位</th><th>被训练</th>
      <th>随机（好运气）</th><th>规则（好策略）</th></tr>
  <tr><td>地区分身（turn&lt;72）</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.region.new_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.region.rainbow_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.region.trained_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.region.rainbow_luck }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.region.rainbow_strategy }}</td></tr>
  <tr><td>超级拉面分身（turn≥72，训练卡）</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.super_ramen_clones.new_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.super_ramen_clones.rainbow_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.super_ramen_clones.trained_clones }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.super_ramen_clones.rainbow_luck }}</td>
      <td class="num">{{ digest.clones.super_ramen_clones.rainbow_strategy }}</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="note">地区分身逐次彩圈明细（只列产生了彩圈的；来源「运气好」= 随机有效增加，「规则性增加」= 规则把缺席卡带入得意位）</div>
{% if region_rows | length > 0 %}
<ul>
  {% for r in region_rows %}
  <li>{{ r.text }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>
{% else %}
<div class="note">本局地区分身未产生彩圈</div>
{% endif %}
</details>
</section>
{% endif %}

{% if narrative.summary %}{{ narrative.summary | safe }}{% else %}<!-- NARRATIVE:summary -->{% endif %}

<section>
<details open>
<summary>口径速览</summary>
<footer>
  <div>· 评分 = AI 端按实际终局五维 + 技能点折算的估算（含切者/小切 PT 加成）：略高于小黑板与实际分数，不含已学技能分</div>
  <div>· 运气分 = 期望终局分累计变化：年界 / 继承 / RMJ / 开局地区选择已作位置标记（跨年假跳基本消除，按性质归因）；&lt; -2000 才判「运气差」（录制年代注记见 digest.context.criteria）</div>
  <div>· 完整判据与赛程 / 覆盖数据块见 digest.json（context / schedule / coverage）；逐条决策见 decisions.csv</div>
</footer>
</details>
</section>

</div></body></html>
